WEBVTT

00:19.728 --> 00:23.940
SOU Sergeant Kim Cheon-gyu
has been confirmed dead in the explosion.

00:24.024 --> 00:27.152
Furthermore, the lead investigator,
Min Gang-yong,

00:27.235 --> 00:31.531
was critically wounded
and rushed to a nearby hospital.

00:35.035 --> 00:36.995
12 CASUALTIES IN GANGNAM HOTEL EXPLOSION

01:08.318 --> 01:09.611
LEE WOO-JEONG, WOO-JIN

01:11.738 --> 01:12.572
Hello.

01:13.156 --> 01:14.699
It's Woo-jeong. This is a group call.

01:15.325 --> 01:17.243
-Can you hear me?
-Yes.

01:17.327 --> 01:18.203
Yes, Woo-jeong.

01:18.286 --> 01:19.829
Where are you two right now?

01:19.913 --> 01:22.916
I'm at a car repair shop with Mr. Moon.

01:22.999 --> 01:26.169
We've got the girl who drugged Min-beom.

01:26.753 --> 01:27.837
And you, Gun-woo?

01:29.589 --> 01:32.717
Gang-yong's been hurt,
so I'm at the hospital.

01:33.510 --> 01:34.803
He's hurt?

01:34.886 --> 01:37.806
-Why is Gang-yong hurt? How?
-Woo-jin.

01:37.889 --> 01:40.433
Could you please hold on a moment?

01:40.517 --> 01:41.351
Sure.

01:41.935 --> 01:44.145
Gun-woo, what's the situation?

01:45.146 --> 01:46.106
Gang-yong…

01:47.982 --> 01:49.609
went in for a CT scan.

01:50.110 --> 01:50.944
How is he?

01:55.115 --> 01:56.533
He's unconscious.

01:57.909 --> 01:59.869
-He's unconscious.
-Fuck!

02:02.956 --> 02:06.751
Could you stay at the hospital
and keep me posted?

02:08.628 --> 02:09.462
Yes, I will.

02:09.546 --> 02:11.673
Woo-jin, text me the shop address.

02:11.756 --> 02:13.424
I'll head over there now.

02:13.925 --> 02:15.343
I'll send it right away.

02:49.502 --> 02:51.796
BLOODHOUNDS 2

03:12.358 --> 03:13.193
Wait here.

03:13.276 --> 03:14.569
Yes, sir.

03:15.987 --> 03:18.448
I've been meaning to visit
since your father told me,

03:18.948 --> 03:19.991
but I'm a bit late.

03:21.201 --> 03:22.535
How can I help?

03:22.619 --> 03:23.828
I need someone.

03:26.206 --> 03:27.332
What for?

03:27.415 --> 03:29.667
I want someone dead.

03:30.877 --> 03:31.961
The one who drugged you?

03:34.839 --> 03:36.174
The person behind it.

03:41.554 --> 03:45.225
Did you do something wrong?

03:55.777 --> 03:58.321
I have an employee who's very thorough.

03:59.197 --> 04:01.491
I'll put him on the job.

04:02.867 --> 04:04.327
But I'll decide

04:05.703 --> 04:07.288
whether he should be removed.

04:07.997 --> 04:10.083
I'll return the favor. I promise.

04:11.251 --> 04:12.335
I'll try my best

04:13.419 --> 04:14.754
to go in that direction.

04:15.672 --> 04:17.298
Thank you, Uncle.

04:18.883 --> 04:20.635
Tell me! Who gave the order?

04:20.718 --> 04:22.136
Shut up!

04:22.220 --> 04:23.846
For fuck's sake!

04:26.391 --> 04:29.352
Look, missy,
I'm not in the mood for games.

04:29.435 --> 04:30.853
Talk, okay?

04:30.937 --> 04:32.230
Who gave the order?

04:33.022 --> 04:34.190
Come close.

04:37.819 --> 04:38.653
Tell me.

04:39.904 --> 04:40.905
Closer.

04:40.989 --> 04:43.533
Why? Cut the crap and just spit it out!

04:43.616 --> 04:45.535
It's a secret. That's why.

04:52.208 --> 04:54.585
Now, tell me. What secret?

04:56.087 --> 04:56.921
What?

04:59.549 --> 05:02.385
-Damn it! Let go! Now!
-Fuck!

05:02.468 --> 05:05.054
-Are you fucking crazy?
-Are you okay?

05:05.555 --> 05:06.472
Get off me.

05:07.473 --> 05:09.517
-Don't do it!
-Fuck. Let go of me!

05:09.600 --> 05:11.394
-Let me go!
-Take it easy.

05:11.477 --> 05:12.770
Okay, I got it!

05:12.854 --> 05:14.063
Mr. Moon.

05:19.485 --> 05:20.528
I'm good.

05:21.029 --> 05:22.989
Relax. I'm good.

05:26.701 --> 05:27.577
Is this funny?

05:27.660 --> 05:29.996
Yeah, it's fucking hilarious.

05:30.079 --> 05:31.998
"It's hilarious," huh?

05:32.999 --> 05:34.834
My side hurts.

05:35.626 --> 05:37.378
Oh damn.

05:37.879 --> 05:39.839
You've got a fine set of legs.

05:39.922 --> 05:41.591
I bet you were popular.

05:43.593 --> 05:44.677
But what do we do?

05:45.178 --> 05:47.013
If your knees get shattered,

05:48.306 --> 05:50.308
you'll end up limping for life, missy.

05:52.727 --> 05:54.062
Are you ready for that?

06:01.152 --> 06:01.986
Please don't.

06:04.364 --> 06:08.201
I'm so scared. Please don't hurt me.

06:08.284 --> 06:10.286
I'm so sorry. Don't do it.

06:10.370 --> 06:12.705
That's more like it. It's okay.

06:12.789 --> 06:15.666
Now stop crying and tell me.

06:17.168 --> 06:18.169
"Tell me."

06:21.839 --> 06:24.342
You fucking idiot.
You look like a total moron.

06:24.425 --> 06:26.010
-Fuck! Get off me!
-Easy!

06:26.094 --> 06:27.387
Get off me, bastard!

06:27.470 --> 06:29.013
-Take it easy!
-Get off!

06:29.972 --> 06:31.224
Goddamn it!

06:32.016 --> 06:34.143
Hey, you…

06:36.020 --> 06:37.313
Do you want to be punished?

06:37.897 --> 06:38.773
Yeah.

06:39.565 --> 06:41.275
I like being punished.

06:41.776 --> 06:43.403
How will you punish me?

06:51.411 --> 06:52.245
Hit me.

06:52.912 --> 06:53.746
Go ahead.

06:55.206 --> 06:56.749
Hit me.

07:07.009 --> 07:09.512
If I open my mouth here,

07:10.179 --> 07:12.140
the guy who paid me

07:12.640 --> 07:15.059
will cut my feet off

07:15.768 --> 07:18.521
and dump me in a whorehouse
in Southeast Asia.

07:21.149 --> 07:23.317
That would shut you up too, right?

07:35.788 --> 07:38.082
LEE WOO-JEONG

07:40.626 --> 07:42.295
Over here, Woo-jeong.

07:52.597 --> 07:53.931
What's happening now?

07:54.015 --> 07:57.059
We've been asking who put her to work,
but she won't talk.

07:57.768 --> 07:59.187
She's a hard case.

07:59.687 --> 08:01.230
She even bit Mr. Moon's ear.

08:01.314 --> 08:03.149
Did things get violent?

08:03.232 --> 08:06.903
No, we didn't hit her or anything.

08:08.779 --> 08:13.951
So she contacted Mr. Min first
and gave him the hotel address?

08:14.035 --> 08:16.787
No, Tae-yeong hacked her phone
to get that.

08:17.914 --> 08:22.084
Woo-jeong, maybe you should go in
and meet her yourself.

08:23.294 --> 08:25.755
What's her name again?

08:26.255 --> 08:29.550
Come on, I just need a smoke.

08:30.092 --> 08:32.428
Damn it, you're a fucking killjoy.

08:32.512 --> 08:34.263
What a piece of work.

08:34.347 --> 08:35.306
-Mr. Moon.
-Yeah.

08:35.389 --> 08:36.557
-Hello.
-There you are.

08:36.641 --> 08:39.227
-Hello.
-Woo-jeong, you came.

08:40.394 --> 08:42.688
She is impossible.

08:42.772 --> 08:44.524
Let me talk to her.

08:44.607 --> 08:45.483
Please.

08:56.202 --> 08:57.537
Who told you to sit?

09:05.920 --> 09:08.464
Fuck off, you prick.

09:16.973 --> 09:19.100
Can't you hear me? I told you to fuck off!

09:19.183 --> 09:20.935
Damn it. Seriously?

09:24.772 --> 09:25.898
May I sit?

09:42.623 --> 09:43.457
I

09:44.834 --> 09:46.085
would like you

09:47.211 --> 09:49.589
to cooperate with us.

09:55.595 --> 09:57.388
I can wait longer if you want.

09:59.724 --> 10:02.184
Who the fuck brought this bastard?

10:06.272 --> 10:07.273
Hey.

10:08.232 --> 10:10.109
Just say it and fuck off.

10:10.192 --> 10:13.613
The police hit the hotel using the intel
they pulled from your cell.

10:15.031 --> 10:16.282
Did you know that?

10:17.867 --> 10:19.243
Your client probably thinks

10:19.327 --> 10:22.705
you leaked the intel
and is likely hunting for you.

10:24.540 --> 10:29.378
You know better than we do
that they won't forgive you.

10:29.962 --> 10:31.839
No matter how much you explain,

10:31.922 --> 10:33.674
they'll never believe you.

10:33.758 --> 10:36.677
They'll hunt you down
and have their revenge.

10:37.261 --> 10:41.057
But if you cooperate…
we'll guarantee your safety.

10:41.140 --> 10:44.810
How could you possibly protect me?

10:45.394 --> 10:49.023
If we catch them,
there won't be anyone to come after you.

10:49.523 --> 10:52.735
That's first.
The next would be a reduced sentence.

10:52.818 --> 10:56.280
Fuck! Are you nuts?
Why would I go to jail?

10:56.364 --> 10:57.948
-Is that a threat, fuckface?
-Okay.

10:58.032 --> 11:00.326
It's not a threat, Gi-na.

11:00.826 --> 11:02.578
Work with us.

11:06.207 --> 11:08.501
We'll help you walk away unscathed.

11:10.419 --> 11:11.629
I give you my word.

11:32.316 --> 11:33.317
Untie me.

11:34.026 --> 11:34.860
It hurts.

11:39.323 --> 11:41.283
Sun-bo, do you have a knife?

11:41.367 --> 11:42.785
Woo-jeong, I don't think…

12:00.010 --> 12:02.221
Thank you, Sun-bo.

12:10.938 --> 12:13.065
Lee Man-bae hired me.

12:13.858 --> 12:14.900
Where is he now?

12:16.485 --> 12:18.738
How should I know?

12:18.821 --> 12:20.823
We only meet when he has a job for me.

12:21.323 --> 12:22.950
How long have you known him?

12:24.243 --> 12:27.121
Three years.
Since he gave me my first job.

12:27.204 --> 12:28.622
What kind of job was it?

12:30.332 --> 12:33.836
Hey, do you think
it's something I can talk about?

12:33.919 --> 12:35.212
You little…

12:37.298 --> 12:40.384
Then who is Lee Man-bae working with now?

12:41.135 --> 12:42.386
I don't know.

12:42.887 --> 12:43.929
I only meet him.

12:44.013 --> 12:48.017
Isn't there anything else
you can give us on Lee Man-bae?

12:51.145 --> 12:51.979
Hey, mister.

12:58.694 --> 13:00.237
A piece of work, that one.

13:22.134 --> 13:27.056
We once drank until we blacked out.

13:27.139 --> 13:28.516
He told me then that

13:29.099 --> 13:30.643
he used to work for the NIS.

13:31.685 --> 13:35.314
He left the NIS
after some type of money trouble.

13:35.815 --> 13:37.608
He was at a dead end,

13:37.691 --> 13:41.278
so he started brokering introductions
between his old NIS contacts for money.

13:41.362 --> 13:43.614
It felt real to me.

13:43.697 --> 13:46.867
But I don't know everything.
He's such a closed book.

13:48.077 --> 13:49.328
Do you have his number?

13:51.121 --> 13:52.832
The number changes every time.

13:53.332 --> 13:55.209
And he never answers my calls.

13:56.085 --> 13:59.630
I just text and wait.

14:04.093 --> 14:05.970
What did you put in Min-beom's drink?

14:07.680 --> 14:08.514
Hey, four-eyes.

14:09.098 --> 14:11.016
-Yes?
-Bring me my purse.

14:37.960 --> 14:40.129
Help us meet Lee Man-bae.

14:46.760 --> 14:48.512
They'll fuck me over.

14:51.265 --> 14:52.266
Listen.

14:53.142 --> 14:55.060
We're in the same boat now.

14:56.020 --> 14:58.898
Us catching them is your only way out.

15:01.108 --> 15:02.693
Damn it.

15:10.826 --> 15:13.245
It's too late. I'll do it tomorrow.

15:16.540 --> 15:18.250
Let's go to our hotel.

15:18.334 --> 15:19.752
Your place is dangerous.

15:20.252 --> 15:22.004
We'll protect you.

15:36.560 --> 15:37.561
This way, please.

16:07.341 --> 16:09.134
-Gun-woo.
-Gun-woo.

16:15.474 --> 16:17.559
I thought you were at the hospital.

16:18.268 --> 16:19.186
Are you okay?

16:21.105 --> 16:23.399
The doctor told me to go home.

16:24.400 --> 16:25.234
Okay.

16:29.238 --> 16:30.406
How's Gang-yong?

16:33.409 --> 16:35.077
He's still in the ER.

16:37.621 --> 16:39.331
When I left,

16:40.416 --> 16:41.667
he was still unconscious.

16:46.839 --> 16:47.840
What about you?

16:48.632 --> 16:50.384
Did you get hurt? Are you okay?

16:52.678 --> 16:53.637
I

16:55.222 --> 16:57.141
thought about it a lot.

16:58.600 --> 17:01.812
I've gone over it again and again.

17:05.315 --> 17:06.442
I'm certain…

17:09.862 --> 17:11.280
that it's all my fault.

17:12.031 --> 17:13.991
No, this really isn't your fault.

17:14.074 --> 17:15.200
If I had just--

17:15.284 --> 17:18.037
Gun-woo, listen to me, okay?

17:18.620 --> 17:20.664
Listen to me, Gun-woo.

17:20.748 --> 17:24.126
Kim Gun-woo. Look at me, okay?

17:28.547 --> 17:31.008
Min-beom, Gang-yong, and Mr. Moon

17:31.675 --> 17:34.344
all chose to join this fight.

17:35.012 --> 17:38.599
You know they would've fought
even if you'd tried to stop them.

17:39.308 --> 17:41.310
And honestly?

17:41.393 --> 17:46.023
I think them stepping up to fight
is the right thing to do.

17:46.648 --> 17:47.483
Why?

17:48.901 --> 17:50.194
Gun-woo.

17:51.820 --> 17:54.740
You risked your life for us first.

17:55.699 --> 18:00.746
We are all connected to each other
through you, Gun-woo.

18:02.039 --> 18:04.374
If you disappeared from our lives,

18:05.125 --> 18:06.502
it'd be like…

18:08.212 --> 18:09.922
I can't even imagine.

18:11.465 --> 18:14.301
So if you're in trouble,

18:14.802 --> 18:17.721
we all come together to protect you.

18:18.305 --> 18:22.059
Look at Gang-yong and Mr. Moon.
They're a cop and a loan shark.

18:22.559 --> 18:25.020
They're a total mismatch,
but they're a team now.

18:25.104 --> 18:26.855
How do you think they pulled that off?

18:27.564 --> 18:28.524
Gun-woo.

18:29.817 --> 18:31.777
Through you, Kim Gun-woo…

18:34.196 --> 18:35.864
we've become a family.

18:36.990 --> 18:39.201
Problems don't occur because of you.

18:40.285 --> 18:42.079
We are alive thanks to you.

18:42.579 --> 18:44.915
Did you hear me? I'm alive thanks to you.

18:52.256 --> 18:53.257
Gun-woo.

18:55.926 --> 18:57.928
What's our rule, huh?

18:59.471 --> 19:00.639
Once family…

19:04.143 --> 19:05.894
Always family.

19:05.978 --> 19:06.979
And family?

19:10.065 --> 19:11.608
Protects

19:13.235 --> 19:14.319
each other

19:15.863 --> 19:17.322
until the end.

19:18.657 --> 19:21.160
Min-beom and Gang-yong will get up soon.

19:21.243 --> 19:24.037
They're really tough, you know?

19:25.205 --> 19:30.127
So you should pull yourself together.

19:31.461 --> 19:32.462
You got that?

19:40.053 --> 19:40.888
Okay.

19:44.391 --> 19:45.267
Okay.

19:48.562 --> 19:49.730
You must be hungry.

19:52.816 --> 19:55.444
Woo-jeong, aren't you hungry?

19:55.944 --> 19:57.654
Should we order room service?

19:58.155 --> 19:59.531
Yes, sounds good.

20:13.003 --> 20:14.296
You're right.

20:15.923 --> 20:17.007
That's why

20:18.383 --> 20:20.886
I should protect my family myself.

20:27.100 --> 20:28.018
Wait.

20:28.518 --> 20:29.353
This bastard.

20:32.272 --> 20:33.398
Gun-woo will struggle.

20:33.982 --> 20:36.401
He's got a crazy long reach. Next.

20:37.110 --> 20:37.945
Scroll down.

20:39.696 --> 20:40.572
There.

20:43.283 --> 20:44.785
This fucker.

20:44.868 --> 20:46.161
He's a dirty boxer.

20:46.662 --> 20:48.538
He's the total opposite of Gun-woo.

20:49.915 --> 20:51.083
Good.

20:51.667 --> 20:52.793
This should be fun.

20:58.048 --> 21:00.050
Tae-yeong. What is it?

21:01.301 --> 21:02.678
You should look at this.

21:03.178 --> 21:06.556
It says Gun-woo's going to fight
this Thursday at 11:00 p.m.

21:07.891 --> 21:09.059
When was it posted?

21:09.559 --> 21:11.520
I just saw it now.

21:13.480 --> 21:14.356
Where's Gun-woo?

21:14.856 --> 21:16.233
I think he went to the gym.

21:16.316 --> 21:18.318
They'll get to Gun-woo, no matter what.

21:41.925 --> 21:43.343
Look at this.

21:44.011 --> 21:46.430
You've got a linear fracture
in the frontal bone.

21:47.431 --> 21:48.473
What is that?

21:49.891 --> 21:51.643
It's a hairline fracture.

21:52.144 --> 21:54.688
You have a brain bleed,
and the pressure is rising.

21:54.771 --> 21:58.608
You need to rest
until the pressure goes back to normal.

21:59.109 --> 22:01.278
-I understand. Thank you.
-Hold on.

22:02.237 --> 22:04.489
This is serious.

22:05.157 --> 22:07.242
Yes, I understand.

22:07.326 --> 22:09.244
-Thank you.
-We need to monitor you.

22:09.328 --> 22:11.038
Thank you. Have a good day.

22:11.121 --> 22:13.415
You'll need surgery
if the pressure increases.

22:24.968 --> 22:27.137
-No response yet?
-No.

22:28.805 --> 22:32.726
On average, how long does it take
for Lee Man-bae to respond?

22:33.435 --> 22:35.103
It's different every time.

22:38.648 --> 22:39.900
Get me an iced Americano.

22:54.790 --> 22:57.751
-Did you just work out?
-Yeah, I went to the gym downstairs.

22:57.834 --> 22:59.378
You should've gone with me.

22:59.461 --> 23:02.631
You were out cold,
so I didn't want to wake you.

23:03.298 --> 23:04.132
We should

23:05.717 --> 23:07.135
go together tomorrow.

23:09.721 --> 23:10.555
Okay.

23:15.310 --> 23:17.187
GANG-YONG

23:20.565 --> 23:21.566
Hello?

23:22.109 --> 23:23.902
Our champion, where are you?

23:29.491 --> 23:30.492
Gang-yong.

23:31.618 --> 23:33.745
We're all at the hotel.

23:40.502 --> 23:41.586
-Hello.
-Thank you.

23:43.255 --> 23:44.089
This way.

23:46.049 --> 23:47.217
This way, please.

23:53.723 --> 23:54.724
Sir!

23:55.851 --> 23:57.185
-I'm all right.
-Gang-yong.

23:57.269 --> 23:58.186
-Yes.
-Mr. Min.

23:58.270 --> 24:00.981
-Can you be out and about?
-Well, I'll take it easy.

24:01.064 --> 24:01.898
My goodness.

24:03.608 --> 24:04.860
I'm all right.

24:18.123 --> 24:20.250
-Let's all go in.
-Okay.

24:29.926 --> 24:31.887
Who do you think tipped them off?

24:35.098 --> 24:40.353
I suspected every single detective
and SOU officer on that scene.

24:41.146 --> 24:42.564
But I can't figure it out.

24:43.315 --> 24:46.943
Everyone except the dead is a suspect.

24:47.903 --> 24:52.157
I thought it could be a hotel employee.

24:52.240 --> 24:53.950
I called the front desk earlier.

24:55.994 --> 24:58.413
Then someone could've overheard
and leaked it.

24:59.498 --> 25:00.624
Anyway,

25:01.708 --> 25:03.293
should we dig into this?

25:03.376 --> 25:06.588
Sir, I think it's more efficient
to focus on Lee Man-bae.

25:09.925 --> 25:11.134
We keep this between us.

25:11.968 --> 25:13.386
It's all enemies out there.

25:13.970 --> 25:14.804
Now,

25:16.598 --> 25:17.807
we'll split up.

25:17.891 --> 25:19.684
Woo-jeong and I will be on Lee Man-bae.

25:19.768 --> 25:22.229
And Mr. Woo-jin and Gwang-mu will…

25:22.312 --> 25:25.315
Wait, I'm sorry. I mean, my apologies.

25:25.398 --> 25:28.109
It's okay. Call me whatever you want.

25:29.486 --> 25:32.280
I would like you two
to handle Yun Tae-geom's family.

25:32.364 --> 25:35.158
-We don't know when he might show up.
-Okay.

25:35.242 --> 25:36.284
Sir.

25:36.785 --> 25:38.703
We found the drug
in President Hong's drink

25:38.787 --> 25:40.413
and sent it to the NFS.

25:40.497 --> 25:43.375
Good. When will the results come back?

25:43.458 --> 25:44.918
They'll let us know in two days.

25:45.418 --> 25:46.962
Okay, well done.

25:50.298 --> 25:51.132
Gun-woo.

25:53.718 --> 25:54.844
-Gun-woo.
-Yes?

25:54.928 --> 25:57.138
Mr. Min's talking to you.

25:58.014 --> 25:58.848
Yes, Gang-yong.

26:00.600 --> 26:01.768
What do you want to do?

26:02.727 --> 26:04.396
About what?

26:05.397 --> 26:06.439
Gang-yong.

26:06.523 --> 26:10.569
Maybe Gun-woo should stay here.

26:11.361 --> 26:14.322
Yeah, the IKFC site posted this morning

26:14.406 --> 26:17.284
that Gun-woo will be fighting
on Thursday night.

26:17.993 --> 26:21.037
They'll do whatever it takes
to lure him in.

26:22.956 --> 26:25.625
This place is safe.
The security team is here.

26:27.919 --> 26:30.589
That sounds right to me.

26:30.672 --> 26:32.173
Hang in there a little longer.

26:33.049 --> 26:35.093
And let's catch these bastards.

26:36.303 --> 26:37.387
Okay.

26:37.470 --> 26:38.305
Gang-yong.

26:39.472 --> 26:41.016
Should we give a big team shout?

26:46.021 --> 26:48.940
-Okay. One, two, three.
-Let's do this!

26:50.233 --> 26:51.735
-Half.
-Call.

26:51.818 --> 26:53.069
-Call.
-Call.

26:55.238 --> 26:56.239
Half.

26:57.449 --> 26:58.783
-Half.
-Call.

26:58.867 --> 26:59.909
Call.

27:02.287 --> 27:03.705
-Half.
-Call.

27:03.788 --> 27:05.206
-Call.
-Call.

27:07.250 --> 27:08.877
-Half.
-Call.

27:08.960 --> 27:09.836
Call.

28:04.432 --> 28:05.684
Fuck.

28:13.108 --> 28:16.778
TARGET IN FRONT OF SOCIETY CAFE
ELIMINATE IMMEDIATELY

29:02.907 --> 29:03.742
What happened?

29:05.201 --> 29:06.703
Gi-na!

29:06.786 --> 29:07.787
Damn it.

29:09.456 --> 29:11.040
Look at me, Gi-na!

29:11.124 --> 29:12.250
Someone's been injured!

29:12.333 --> 29:15.712
674, Seoksan-dong, Jungang-gu.
Please hurry!

30:33.414 --> 30:35.291
I'm going for a walk.

30:59.858 --> 31:00.859
Follow me.

31:43.860 --> 31:44.819
Sit down.

31:57.999 --> 31:59.250
Good to see your face.

32:00.251 --> 32:02.003
You should've come earlier.

32:03.546 --> 32:04.797
You little piece of shit.

32:07.050 --> 32:08.843
I lost billions because of you.

32:12.388 --> 32:13.514
Anyway…

32:16.100 --> 32:17.477
what do you fight for?

32:22.482 --> 32:23.316
Family?

32:26.319 --> 32:27.278
Friends?

32:31.157 --> 32:34.327
Those things don't last.
Everyone leaves eventually.

32:35.370 --> 32:37.914
Only money stays.

32:38.873 --> 32:40.792
Only money protects you.

32:44.379 --> 32:46.589
I fucking love money.

32:48.549 --> 32:49.968
Money never betrays you.

32:55.098 --> 32:57.183
People invented boxing for money.

32:58.518 --> 32:59.936
Same weight, long fight.

33:00.019 --> 33:02.730
Long fights mean
live broadcasts and commercials.

33:04.023 --> 33:05.733
Fighters have to fight long.

33:06.275 --> 33:08.736
So they give just enough rest
to keep them alive.

33:12.323 --> 33:13.408
All these rules

33:14.242 --> 33:15.952
were made to make money.

33:19.163 --> 33:20.164
So,

33:21.749 --> 33:23.459
I'll help you make money.

33:24.460 --> 33:25.294
Okay?

33:31.009 --> 33:32.427
I don't need money.

33:33.386 --> 33:34.637
Let's get this over with.

33:43.688 --> 33:44.772
Fuck you.

33:46.607 --> 33:48.067
Drop two fighters first.

33:51.988 --> 33:52.822
Oh.

33:55.158 --> 33:56.159
If you lose…

33:58.327 --> 34:00.121
your whole family fucking dies.

34:34.739 --> 34:36.449
-Gun-woo!
-Gun-woo.

34:36.532 --> 34:38.409
-What's wrong?
-Isn't he in there?

34:38.493 --> 34:40.328
He went out for a walk earlier.

34:40.411 --> 34:41.245
What?

34:43.498 --> 34:44.916
GUN-WOO

34:45.625 --> 34:49.253
The phone is turned off.
You'll be redirected to voicemail.

34:57.845 --> 34:59.555
Put these on and wrap your knuckles.

35:02.141 --> 35:03.601
Everyone does it.

35:04.769 --> 35:06.729
I'll fight my own way.

35:06.813 --> 35:08.815
You can't win without these.

35:30.378 --> 35:32.547
Goddamn it.

37:20.529 --> 37:22.281
The reaction is insane.

37:26.619 --> 37:29.497
They're saying
Scarface may be stronger than Hunter.

37:38.673 --> 37:39.882
"KOERI." Look it up.

37:45.179 --> 37:47.265
The Korea Ocean
Engineering Research Institute.

37:47.348 --> 37:48.766
-Send in the team.
-Yes, sir.

37:56.399 --> 37:57.858
Hey, champion.

37:57.942 --> 37:59.485
Let's do this.

38:05.950 --> 38:07.201
Come on, take this!

38:27.096 --> 38:28.764
Come on. Hit me!

39:36.207 --> 39:37.041
Get down here!

39:53.974 --> 39:56.227
-Upload this bastard to the intranet.
-Okay.

40:44.442 --> 40:45.693
Fucking hell.

42:13.656 --> 42:15.574
Oh no, my poor Gun-woo.

43:20.848 --> 43:22.558
Shit, the police are here.

43:22.641 --> 43:24.476
We need to get out in three minutes!

43:25.311 --> 43:26.895
The police! Everyone out!

43:29.857 --> 43:32.276
Sir, no! You should leave now!

43:32.359 --> 43:33.611
Get off, you fucker!

43:33.694 --> 43:35.613
The police are here. You should leave now!

43:39.074 --> 43:41.118
-It's locked.
-Get the bolt cutters!

43:41.702 --> 43:42.536
Here it is!

43:43.954 --> 43:44.830
Damn it!

43:53.589 --> 43:55.049
-It's open!
-Run!

43:55.633 --> 43:56.800
Run! That way! Get in!

43:56.884 --> 43:58.427
Get in! Hurry!

44:03.932 --> 44:05.559
Someone's over there!

44:10.439 --> 44:11.899
Run! Hurry!

44:13.567 --> 44:14.693
Ambulance!

44:30.626 --> 44:31.669
Woo-jin.

44:34.254 --> 44:35.255
Gun-woo.

44:37.800 --> 44:39.843
Easy.

44:42.304 --> 44:43.597
When did you get here?

44:46.141 --> 44:47.893
About an hour ago.

44:50.354 --> 44:51.438
Are you okay?

44:54.775 --> 44:55.609
Yes.

44:56.777 --> 44:57.945
Why did you do that?

44:59.613 --> 45:00.864
He said if I didn't come…

45:03.701 --> 45:05.452
he'd hurt you and Mom.

45:11.959 --> 45:13.544
I'm glad it's not worse.

45:15.713 --> 45:16.547
I'm sorry.

45:18.382 --> 45:20.300
Why are you sorry?

45:22.428 --> 45:23.762
I'm sorry.

45:24.972 --> 45:27.683
Gun-woo, you did it for us.

45:28.183 --> 45:29.309
I knew that.

45:30.519 --> 45:31.854
That's who you are.

45:35.441 --> 45:36.692
But, Gun-woo.

45:38.527 --> 45:40.237
Mr. Choi told us…

45:43.157 --> 45:45.576
that we should always stick together.

45:52.541 --> 45:54.501
From now on, no matter what happens,

45:55.502 --> 45:57.045
let's stick together.

45:58.881 --> 46:00.716
If we die, we die together.

46:01.425 --> 46:03.135
If we live, we live together.

46:05.012 --> 46:06.388
That's us.

46:22.613 --> 46:24.865
Im Baek-jeong, born in 1985.

46:24.948 --> 46:28.327
He won silver as a light heavyweight
at the 2014 Incheon Asian Games.

46:28.410 --> 46:31.413
He turned pro
and went on a 17-fight win streak

46:31.497 --> 46:35.250
until he lost a decision to
WBA light heavyweight champ, Chris Dustin.

46:35.334 --> 46:37.127
But while protesting the decision,

46:37.211 --> 46:40.422
he assaulted the referee
and got into a brawl with his own coach.

46:40.506 --> 46:42.466
He served time for the assault.

46:42.549 --> 46:46.178
After being banned
from the boxing association, he vanished.

46:49.598 --> 46:50.474
Issue the warrant.

46:51.350 --> 46:52.518
Yes, sir.

48:17.394 --> 48:19.021
You fucking bastard!

48:21.607 --> 48:22.774
What are you doing?

48:22.858 --> 48:25.736
This is what we wanted.
He offered us 400 million dollars!

48:30.699 --> 48:31.658
Wanna fucking die?

48:32.367 --> 48:33.785
I'll handle it my way.

48:34.286 --> 48:35.537
You fucking bastard.

48:37.289 --> 48:39.124
Shut your fucking trap.

48:39.833 --> 48:41.376
-Okay?
-Okay!

48:57.726 --> 48:58.560
Sir.

49:02.230 --> 49:03.273
The police

49:03.982 --> 49:05.901
put a warrant out on you.

49:06.735 --> 49:07.569
What?

49:08.570 --> 49:09.738
What happened?

49:09.821 --> 49:13.450
You should get out of Korea
as soon as possible.

49:14.409 --> 49:16.954
I'll arrange a private jet for you.

49:18.580 --> 49:22.209
Fuck! Damn it!

49:25.337 --> 49:26.421
Get Gun-woo's mom.

49:26.505 --> 49:27.589
Sir?

49:28.173 --> 49:30.759
I have to take his mom
so the bastard will follow!

49:32.594 --> 49:34.054
It's a death match this time.

49:34.554 --> 49:36.515
One of us will fucking die.

49:37.641 --> 49:39.101
Fucking bastards.

49:39.601 --> 49:41.770
I'll show them who the real deal is.

49:42.437 --> 49:44.106
I'm gonna tear it all down.

52:37.487 --> 52:42.492
Subtitle translation by: Jooyea Lee
